comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-31T00:56:15.841Z","harness:claude-code","Evidence: pnpm audit --json on the pre-repair lock listed 1244003 (follow-redirects 1.16.1, path .>@codspeed/vitest-plugin>@codspeed/core>axios>follow-redirects) and 1244012 (minimatch 10.2.6, paths via @eslint/js>eslint>@eslint/config-array and eslint directly); GitHub Dependabot had no alert for either package in any state. After raising the overrides, pnpm install changed only the two entries (follow-redirects 1.16.1 -> 1.16.2, minimatch 10.2.6 -> 11.0.3; 20 insertions, 13 deletions in pnpm-lock.yaml). node scripts/release/dependency-advisories/gate.mjs exits 0 with both feeds complete and empty id lists; pnpm lint:eslint passes with minimatch 11.0.3; check-dependency-cooldown, runtime-lock check and check-development-dependencies (CodSpeed bundle integrity) all pass. Published 2026-10-25 and 2026-10-28, both releases clear pnpm's one-day minimum release age without an exclusion; Dependabot's seven-day scheduling cooldown is unaffected."
